OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,4,F
OL,5, A woman shop assistant has been killed
OL,6, and 34 other people injured in a bomb
OL,7, attack in Northern Ireland.
OL,9,FThe bomb was inside a van left outside
OL,10,Fthe RUC station at Warrenpoint, County
OL,11,FDown. No warning was given until after
OL,12,Fthe blast.
OL,14,FThe explosion destroyed two buildings
OL,15,Fand damaged hundreds of homes. Seven
OL,16,Fpeople have been detained in hospital;
OL,17,Ftheir conditions are said to be stable.
OL,19,FNorthern Ireland minister Mr Ian
OL,20,FStewart said the attack was "violence
OL,21,Ffor the sake of violence".
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 12-04-89 / teletextarchive.com
