OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,4,F
OL,5, The 1986 Chinook helicopter crash off
OL,6, Shetland in which 45 people died was
OL,7, caused by a failure of the aircraft's
OL,8, gear system, says an official riport.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FThe report of the Department of
OL,11,FTransport's Air Accident Investigation
OL,12,FBranch says the failure was brought
OL,13,Fabout by a new design of bolted joint.
OL,15,FNeither the authorities nor the makers,
OL,16,FBoeing, explored the joint's working
OL,17,Fcharacteristics enough to expose its
OL,18,F"inherent weakness", says the report.
OL,19,F
OL,20,FIt calls for all modifications to vital
OL,21,Fparts to be "adequately scrutinised".
OL,22,F
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,190,120,250,0,100
PN,18105
SC,0005
CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1776025044
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G5/13
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,4,F
OL,5, Manufacturers and air authorities were
OL,6, wrong to assume that a new joint would
OL,7, behave like the old one, says a report
OL,8, on the 1986 Chinook helicopter crash.
OL,10,FIt says the previous processes of
OL,11,Fapproval used by the Federal Aviation
OL,12,FAdministratign and the Civil Aviation
OL,13,FAuthority were inadequate for such
OL,14,Fa modified vital component.
OL,15,F
OL,16,FIt concluded that better monitoring
OL,17,Fmight have given indications which
OL,18,Fcould have prevented the accident.
OL,20,FThe report also recommended a review
OL,21,Fof the certification process.
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,190,120,250,0,100
PN,18106
SC,0006
CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1776025044
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G6/13
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,4,F
OL,5, Publication of the original AAIB report
OL,6, into the 1986 Chinook helicopter crash
OL,7, was delayed because the makers, Boeing,
OL,8, asked for a review of the report.
OL,10,FThe Department of Transport's Review
OL,11,FBoard carried out the review and agreed
OL,12,Fwith the AAIB's findings.
OL,14,FBut Boeing was concerned that the
OL,15,FReview Board report contained a
OL,16,F"serious miscarriage of justice" and
OL,17,Fthis further delayed its publication.
OL,19,FThe DoT said today that there was no
OL,20,Fground for suspecting that there had
OL,21,Fbeen a miscarriage of justice.
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,190,120,250,0,100
PN,18107
SC,0007
CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1776025044
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G7/13
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Boeing has accepted the official
OL,6, report's view of the cause of the 1986
OL,7, Chinook helicopter crash.
OL,9,FThe plane manufacturer also accepted
OL,10,Fthe report's conclusion that test
OL,11,Fprocedures were not adequate.
OL,13,FBut Boeing pointed out that the
OL,14,Fmodification on the crashed helicopter
OL,15,Fhad not been made properly.
OL,16,F
OL,17,FBoeing added that a senior engineer
OL,18,Fwith the operating company had said
OL,19,Fthat something was wrong two months
OL,20,Fbefore the accident, but his
OL,21,Frecommendations were not followed.
OL,22,F
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
